ow a little  diversity so kids will understand that  love is love this is why most people  were really happy to meet them  unfortunately not everyone agreed with  this decision the controversy some  people think that's showing a gay couple  on television is not appropriate for  kids this is why the Christian group 1  Million Moms started alerting parents  they said that just because something  may be legal or because some are  choosing a lifestyle doesn't make it  morally correct according to them  Nickelodeon should stick to entertaining  instead of pushing an agenda they even  think that kids face danger when they  are exposed to same-sex marriage because  it forces a premature discussion on  sexual orientation that is  Wheatly uncalled for we are happy that  this group didn't really have the power  to do anything but unfortunately we  can't say the same about other countries  the ban in Kenya in 2017 can you decided  to ban six animated shows that aired on  Nickelodeon and Cartoon Network because  they thought that it was an attempt to  normalized glamorize and glorify  homosexual behavior and impair their  moral judgement on the institution of  the family let's not forget that  homosexuality is illegal in Kenya and  people can go to prison for this this is  why the loud house was banned in the  whole country along with shows like The  Legend of Korra Hey Arnold Steven  universe Adventure Time and clearance  love is not the choice but hate is and  this is why we'd rather watch our  favorite show than ban it for no good  reason the new gender Clyde's parents  are not the only queer people on the  show in Ellis for love we also found out  that Luna had a crush on a girl named  Sam which probably makes her bisexual we  were really happy for her and we hope  that we will have the chance to see  these two once again but did you know  that Sam is actually a little different  in Korea  Sam's gender has changed into a male and  she has a male voice actor people  probably think that this story would be  more appropriate if she were a boy but  we have to disagree with that the  episode that almost got banned another  episode could have been banned and this  time it was for a whole different reason  people just thought that it was  incredibly bad in no such luck  Lincoln is bad luck to everyone in the  family and this is why they all reject  him and he has even kicked out from the  house many people think that this is the  worst the loud house episode ever made  as it promotes child abuse and neglect  and even made some people cry some  people even started a petition online  but we think that 20 M people are not  enough to make Nickelodeon change the  original short the first time we met the  loud family was in an original short  featured on Nickelodeon's 2013 animated  shorts program in this short film  Lincoln simply wanted to go to the  bathroom but first he had to go through  the hallway where all his sisters were  we have already seen this before and  that's because the theme song was based  on this this is what gave Chris Savino  the chance to create his own  made a series that was quickly going to  become the most popular cartoon on  Nickelodeon in 2016 a slightly altered  version of the short premiered on Nick  comm so we can have the chance to see  how it all started  the theme song whenever we hear the  theme song of the loud house we know  that our favorite show is on TV and we  have to watch it now when he was a kid  Chris remembers that the show's gave at  least one minute to an opening title to  set up the whole show he only had 30  seconds for the loud house and he  decided to make the best out of it  he wrote a ton of lyrics and people took  some of them to create a new song that  became an earworm we can't imagine the  loud house without the theme song so we  think that it was totally worth it  this grip and the story board is the  loud house based on the script or the  storyboard chris said that the scripts  are usually 95% there and the storyboard  artists can then add some little things  but the problem with the loud house is  that without a script it would be easy  to forget many of the amazing characters  they have to think about their presence  in the house since the beginning  storyboard artists can also discover new  things when they see a really good  opportunity for a joke a line or a  reaction when a character is just  standing in the way but usually the  final result will look like the script  the comics style so we know that Chris  Savino loved comics when he was a kid  and you can clearly see it when you  watch the show for example the title of  the show looks just like a comic this is  also it makes it easier to animate the  LAT house you usually see the scene from  only one angle and the camera doesn't  move a lot unless it's really necessary  as Chris Savino said characters are  funny the camera is not he wants us to  focus only on them and this is why we  don't really minds if there are no  dramatic shots the voice actors did you  know that seven voice actors are playing  the sisters in the loud house but how is  that possible when there are 10  characters that's because some of them  are actually the voice of many sisters  the talented Grady Lyle is not only Lily  but also Lana and Lola Jessica de Cicco  also plays two really different  characters Lynn and Lucie loud grant  Palmer used to play Lincoln in the first  season but he was replaced by Colin Dean  when he grew  don't you think it's weird to play many  characters that are talking to each  other in the same scene it would  certainly be fun to see the pet names so  we know that people and dogs in the life  of Chris Savino inspired the names of  the loud sisters but did you know that  the names of the pets were inspired by  some people too they were all named  after a famous cartoonist Charles the  dog was named after Charles M Schultz  cliff the cat was inspired by cliff  starett  Gio the hamster is based on Gio McManus  and then Walt the bird is named after  Walt Kelly or Walt Disney Chris was also  inspired by his own family as he lived  with many animals when he was a kid the  colors you have probably noticed this  but each character is associated with  one color but are you able to name all  of them Lincoln is orange Laurie is  light blue Lenny is turquoise Luna is  purple Lou Ann is yellow Lynn is red  Lucy is black Lana is blue Lola is pink  Lisa is green and Lily is lavender you  can clearly see these colors in the  theme song when Lincoln is running  through the hallway and also in the  pictures on the wall we can't believe  that it was there during all this time  and so many of us didn't notice it the  rabbit if you are a fan of the loud  house you probably remember  bun-bun a stuffed rabbit that belongs to  Lincoln he can't even remember a time  where he didn't have bun bun in his life  and has panic attacks whenever he thinks  that something bad could happen to him  but this stuffed animal is also really  meaningful to the Creator you remember  when we told you that the show used to  be based on rabbits well fun bun is  modeled after Lincoln's original design  from when he was going to be a rabbit we  think that the best choice was to make  him human but it's still funny to see  this little bunny in his room the  original Lennie we also found out that  Linney's name was based on the  characters from Of Mice and Men but did  you know that she used to look just like  him - that's right  Lenny used to be an eight-year-old who  was super sweet but didn't know how  strong she was the first design looks  nothing like her she evolved and changed  but savino still wanted to show us how  development works you need to be open to  change your ideas for the better and  this is how we had the chance to fall in  love with the sweet Lenny that we all  know  the end of Chris Savino we talked about  Chris Savino a lot but did you know that  he's not a part of the loud house  anymore he was suspended and later fired  from his own show when many women  accused him of sexual harassment over  the years a Nickelodeon spokesperson  said that they take allegations of  misconduct very seriously and they are  committed to fostering a safe and  professional workplace but don't worry  the loud house will continue to air on  Nickelodeon and be in production do you  know any other secrets about the loud  house don't be shy to tell us what it is  in the comment section down below we  love to hear what you think and that's  it for 20 things about the loud house  you didn't know for more stories like  this make sure you watch five TV shows  that copy the loud house thanks for  watching and see you next time  [Music]
 

